{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0c0b3af7-35b9-89cf-be70-c13f96a793d9",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T14:05:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Conceicao Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:02:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine, good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:02:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. I'm calling about a drain, um, the water's sitting at the curb and it's, it's been like this for days and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me get some details. Where is this, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:02:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 236 Chapel Street. Up on the Hill. I own the building, I'm not there all the time, but my tenants keep telling me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:02:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "236 Chapel Street, got it. And what's happening there, is it flooding?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:02:57-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's not a flood exactly. There's no storm, it's been dry. It's like meltwater, from the snow pile, and it ponds up at the curb by the drain and then at night it freezes. So in the morning it's all black ice, right where people walk. Somebody's going to slip and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a real hazard. So the water collects at the curb and the drain isn't taking it. Is the drain grate itself clear, or is it covered with something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think it's partly blocked, there's leaves and gunk, and ice around it. I can't really tell. My neighbor, the one next door, she said it happens every big rain. Every time. So it's not new."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so your neighbor says it backs up every time it rains hard. And this time it's just from melting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Yeah. And I want to know when they last came by. Like, when did anybody last clean it out? Because nobody's been, as far as I've seen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at that. [pause] I'm checking the work log for that location. Was it Chapel Street you said, or Chapin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:04:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Chapel. Chapel Street. C-H-A-P-E-L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:04:13-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Chapel, okay, sorry. I'm seeing a couple of entries for the area but I can't tell you from here exactly when that particular drain was cleaned. I'll have to put it in as a request and have the crew supervisor tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:04:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you don't know when they last came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:04:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for that exact drain, no. I don't want to tell you a date that's wrong. But I can flag it as an icing hazard, which helps get it looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please do that, because it's going to freeze again tonight, it's supposed to get cold. And I've got people going in and out, an older man on the first floor, and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:04:59-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. In the meantime, if you or your tenants can put some salt or sand down by the ice, that would help. I'll note that it's at the curb in front of 236 Chapel Street, partly blocked, ponding and refreezing. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it. And, um, it keeps happening, I mean, this isn't the first year. Somebody should just fix it so it doesn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll write that down too, that it's recurring. Do you want a call back at a number? I have a cell showing, 401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's me. That's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:05:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll have someone call you back about when it was last serviced and when they can get out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I hope it's soon. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T14:05:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, Ms. Medeiros."
    }
  ],
